{"id":"n60318-2-7","stage":2,"title":"뿌리 · 根","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60318-2-7-1","ko":"이가 흔들려서 병원에 왔어요.","zh":"我的牙齿松动了，所以来医院了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이가","meaning":"牙齿","explanation":"이：牙齿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69529","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이가","audio":"/audio/c15b46bf7bf918f52cd6.mp3"}},{"text":"흔들려서","meaning":"晃，晃动，摇晃，摇摆","explanation":"흔들리다：晃，晃动，摇晃，摇摆；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"흔들리다","audio":"/audio/60a91a20c2ca370e0404.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89241","senseId":"1","lemma":"흔들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흔들려서","audio":"/audio/5aec8143a0c2a9e9d7bf.mp3"}},{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에","audio":"/audio/2610e1319b7ca0517a20.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어요.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어요","audio":"/audio/2ef5daa5f516291289bc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"牙齿","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"69529","definition":"长在人或动物嘴里，用于咬东西或咀嚼食物的器官。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"60a91a20c2ca370e","term":"흔들리다","zh":"晃，晃动，摇晃，摇摆","audio":"/audio/60a91a20c2ca370e0404.mp3","entryId":"89241","definition":"上下、左右或前后来回摆动。","pronunciation":["흔들리다"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e24cbaf35394a3aaacee.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60318-2-7-2","ko":"치아의 뿌리가 많이 약해졌군요.","zh":"看来牙齿的牙根已经变得很脆弱了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"치아의","meaning":"牙齿，牙，齿","explanation":"치아：牙齿，牙，齿；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"치아","audio":"/audio/ead0cd9174a3f364954e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28122","senseId":"1","lemma":"치아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치아의","audio":"/audio/bd944a24dae890ec6815.mp3"}},{"text":"뿌리가","meaning":"根","explanation":"뿌리：根；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뿌리","audio":"/audio/450c8a414b68c9a488bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60318","senseId":"2","lemma":"뿌리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뿌리가","audio":"/audio/659d9e9433d6465b8f00.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"약해졌군요.","meaning":"弱，羸弱，单薄；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"약하다：弱，羸弱，单薄；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"약하다","audio":"/audio/26dfca7d15ecbdb7d4a8.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71619","senseId":"2","lemma":"약하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약해졌군요","audio":"/audio/8607ba76470223e19fe5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ead0cd9174a3f364","term":"치아","zh":"牙齿，牙，齿","audio":"/audio/ead0cd9174a3f364954e.mp3","entryId":"28122","definition":"用于咀嚼食物的器官。","pronunciation":["치아"]},{"id":"450c8a414b68c9a4","term":"뿌리","zh":"根","audio":"/audio/450c8a414b68c9a488bd.mp3","entryId":"60318","definition":"事物深扎在他处的下端部分。","pronunciation":["뿌리"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"26dfca7d15ecbdb7","term":"약하다","zh":"弱，羸弱，单薄","audio":"/audio/26dfca7d15ecbdb7d4a8.mp3","entryId":"71619","definition":"不结实。","pronunciation":["야카다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e9d6bc5c8ab9c44a1b76.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.591,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60318","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4177,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来牙齿的牙根已经变得很脆弱了。","据说智秀从桥上跳进了汉江里。","我的牙齿松动了，所以来医院了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来牙齿的牙根已经变得很脆弱了。","我的牙齿松动了，所以来医院了。","据说智秀从桥上跳进了汉江里。"],"answer":0}]}
